<!-- question: 1 -->
  <question type="stack">
    <name><text>Biostatistics - Q1: RCBD ANOVA</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A study on soybean yield using {@k@} fertilizer types in an RCBD with {@b@} blocks produced the following sums of squares:</p>
<ul>
  <li>\( SSTotal = {@SSTotal@} \)</li>
  <li>\( SSB = {@SSB@} \)</li>
  <li>\( SSTreat = {@SSTreat@} \)</li>
</ul>
<p>Test the hypothesis that fertilizers differ at \( \alpha = 0.05 \). (Assume \( F_{crit}({@k-1@}, {@(k-1)*(b-1)@}) = {@Fcrit@} \)).</p>
<p>1. Calculate \( SSE \): [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>
<p>2. Degrees of freedom for Error (\( df_{Err} \)): [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p>
<p>3. Calculated F-value (\( F_{calc} \)): [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]</p>
<p>4. Decision: [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]]</p>
<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>1. <strong>SSE</strong> = \( SSTotal - SSB - SSTreat = {@SSTotal@} - {@SSB@} - {@SSTreat@} = {@ta1@} \)</p>
<p>2. <strong>df_Err</strong> = \( (b-1)(k-1) = ({@b@}-1)({@k@}-1) = {@ta2@} \)</p>
<p>3. <strong>F_calc</strong>:</p>
<ul>
  <li>\( df_{Treat} = k-1 = {@k-1@} \)</li>
  <li>\( MST = SSTreat / df_{Treat} = {@SSTreat@} / {@k-1@} = {@MST@} \)</li>
  <li>\( MSE = SSE / df_{Err} = {@ta1@} / {@ta2@} \approx {@MSE@} \)</li>
  <li>\( F_{calc} = MST / MSE = {@MST@} / {@MSE@} \approx {@ta3@} \)</li>
</ul>
<p>4. <strong>Decision</strong>: Since \( F_{calc} = {@ta3@} \) is {@if ta3 > Fcrit then "greater" else "less"@} than \( F_{crit} = {@Fcrit@} \), we <strong>{@if ta3 > Fcrit then "Reject" else "Fail to Reject"@} H0</strong>.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <questionvariables>
      <text>k: 4;
b: 3;
SSTreat: 250 + rand(10)*10;
SSB: 80 + rand(5)*10;
SSE_rand: 80 + rand(5)*10;
SSTotal: SSTreat + SSB + SSE_rand;
Fcrit: 4.76;

ta1: SSTotal - SSB - SSTreat;
ta2: (k-1)*(b-1);
MST: SSTreat / (k-1);
MSE: float(ta1 / ta2);
ta3: float(MST / MSE);

ta4: if ta3 > Fcrit then 
       [[1, true, "Reject H0 (Fertilizers differ)"], [2, false, "Fail to Reject H0 (No significant difference)"]]
     else 
       [[1, false, "Reject H0 (Fertilizers differ)"], [2, true, "Fail to Reject H0 (No significant difference)"]];</text>
    </questionvariables>
    <specificfeedback format="html"><text></text></specificfeedback>
    <questionnote format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>SSE={@ta1@}, Fcalc={@ta3@}. Reject: {@ta3 > Fcrit@}</p>]]></text></questionnote>
